window.products.push({"id":688017,"name":"6x6 4 pcs Primavera Talavera Mexican Tile","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EKS2cr02L._AC_.jpg","description":"In the manufacturing process the whole tile is painted in white as a first step and then the rest of the tile is painted on top of the white. This tile can be used as an accent piece or as a decorative wall by itself as shown in the second picture.This tile is special for small patches or entire wall decoration, as you can see from the pattern found in the last picture.DISCLAIMER:All of our Talavera tiles have a heavily hand-made process involved; as such, imperfections are expected. Color variations are to be expected from batch to batch. What you see on your screen might not be exactly what you will get, this is mostly due to several factors, among others: lighting when the picture was taken, lighting in your own monitor, but mostly changes in the glazes used between batches. All these factors are beyond our control. If in doubt, we recommend you to order a sample before committing to a bigger order.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EKS2cr02L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fine Crafts Imports","source_asin":"B00VVW42TQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-688017","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00VVW42TQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00VVW42TQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
