window.products.push({"id":688027,"name":"Farberware Classic Deep Nonstick Frying Pan / Fry Pan / Skillet - 8 Inch, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718ZzP0V8XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Cook a meal for one or two in a flash with the Farberware Classic Series Polished Aluminum Nonstick 8-Inch Deep Frying Pan. The deeper sides of this frying pan make it perfect for both holding and folding omelets filled with all the yummies and the nonstick skillet surface helps to flip eggs easily. Strong, reliable fry pan construction provides quick and even heating, helping to reduce hot spots that can burn foods. A striking polished skillet exterior adds style and personality to the kitchen, and long-lasting nonstick coats the frying pan’s interior. The comfortable fry pan handle is dual riveted for strength, and the frying pan is oven safe to 350°F. This frying pan works beautifully alongside all the other quality pots and pans Farberware offers. A workhorse in the kitchen, the Farberware Classic Series Polished Aluminum Nonstick 8-Inch Deep Frying Pan comes in handy making breakfast, lunch and dinner. Amazon.com Crafted from a blend of materials, this 8-inch-diameter deep skillet from Farberware offers the excellent conductivity of aluminum with the convenience of a nonstick interior. The pan features highly polished 2-1/4-inch sides with a slight slope--great for cooking cornbread or frying meats. Oven-safe to 350 degrees F, the pan requires little oil during cooking, releases food with minimal sticking, and cleans up easily. Its comfortable phenolic handle is stoutly riveted, stays cool during stovetop use, and sports a hanging ring. Farberware recommends hand washing and the use of wooden, plastic, or nylon utensils to best preserve the skillet's interior. --Emily Bedard Brand Story By Farberware See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718ZzP0V8XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Farberware","source_asin":"B076FL7NT6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-688027","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076FL7NT6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076FL7NT6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
