window.products.push({"id":688126,"name":"Knife Set, 14 PCS High Carbon Stainless Steel Super Sharp Kitchen Knife Set for Chef with Acrylic Stand, include Steak Knives, Sharpener and Scissors,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71z3EnKxv-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔪【SHARP AND STURDY KNIFE SET】 - With sleek and modern design, and it won’t take up too much space on your counter. High carbon stain-free stainless steel, provides high durability. The blade superior sharp. Great kitchen top cutlery set! 🔪【UTILITY-DRIVEN KITCHEN KNIFE SET】- All the cooking knives you need, 8\" chef knife, 8\" bread knife, 8\" carving knife, 4.5\" utility knife, 4.5\" steak knife x 6 piece, 3\" paring knife, Shears, stainless steel sharpening, acrylic block. 🔪【ONE PIECE DESIGN】 - Forged continuously in one piece, Knife handle and blade are all made in one piece, so there are no issues of the blade detaching or getting loose from the handle and knives can be last long. 🔪【ERGONOMICAL DESIGN】 - These knives are lightweight, features curved and tapered handles, fit perfectly in hand to maximize control and ensures a more comfortable grip when you’re cutting, slicing, paring, etc. 🔪【ACRYLIC STAND】 - The acrylic stand is transparent so you can clearly see the knife you are going to use and pull out the knife you want, and easy to storage and care. Our 14 piece knife set comes every knife you need.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71z3EnKxv-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"kincano","source_asin":"B0B1GMCQR5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-688126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1GMCQR5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1GMCQR5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":688127,"name":"Plane Magic Tool lube use on Plane soles, table saws, helps prevent rust and smoothes sticky wood slides","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sz9qU1IdL._SL1481_.jpg","description":"Plane Magic Tool lube can be used on the soles of planes, table saws, and other woodworking tools to help prevent rust and smooth out sticky wood slides. This lubricant is specifically designed to reduce friction and improve the performance of woodworking tools, making them easier to use and more effective. To use Plane Magic Tool lube, you should first clean the surfaces of your tools thoroughly to remove any dirt, dust, or debris. Then, apply a small amount of the lubricant to the tool's sole or slide and spread it evenly with a cloth or brush. Be sure to apply only a thin layer of the lubricant, as excess lubricant can attract dust and debris, leading to more problems down the line. Once you've applied the Plane Magic Tool lube, you should notice an immediate improvement in the smoothness and performance of your tools. The lubricant will help reduce friction and prevent rust, making it easier to slide your tools across wood surfaces without sticking or binding. With regular use, Plane Magic Tool lube can help extend the life of your woodworking tools and keep them performing at their best. And comes in an easy-to-use applicator that fits in your apron pocket. NOW IN A NEW ROUND APPLICATOR, That fits better in your shop apron","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sz9qU1IdL._SL1481_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PITA'S WAX CO","source_asin":"B06VVXMCXS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-688127","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06VVXMCXS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06VVXMCXS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
