window.products.push({"id":688420,"name":"Briful Fake Flowers Artificial Tulip Flower White in Clear Vase, Real Touch Foam Tulip Arrangement Suitable for Home Office Decoration, Dining Table C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TgL6jg5iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Incorporate spring coloring year-round with this arrangement of artificial tulips boasting bright cheerful blooms, handsomely complemented with dark, realistic leaves. Reaching 13.5\" high from a decorative vase(2.4\"x2.4\"x6\"), it makes for an enchanting accent all year round. Usher in the beauty of a refreshing spring garden to your home or event’s space with our real touch Artificial Tulip Arrangement. Crafted from high quality soft touch foam with special attention to details on the petals, these Faux Tulips mimic the vibrant hues and natural texture of live Tulips. Soft, smooth foam Tulip Bulbs together with realistic faux foliage are perfect to add an instant and everlasting visual element to your flower arrangement, bouquets, corsages, centerpieces, backdrops, and other floral arrangements. Make everlasting and wilt-free floral decorations, impart a refreshingly radiant charm to your indoor or outdoor. These artificial tulip flowers in clear vase with faux water displays elegantly on tabletops, office desk, windowsills, hallways, dressers, coffee tables, and kitchen cabinets. Our Faux Foam Tulip Bouquets offer everlasting bloom with a look and effect that replicates the natural blossoms. Whether you are hosting a garden party, a birthday celebrations, shower event, or a wedding dinner, our gorgeous Foam Tulips will bring a refreshing floral twist to your space décor! The beautiful fresh looking flower towering above the curvy leaves on this tulip artificial flower will have you thinking spring all year. The set of 8 tulip flowers together in a clear vase creates an interesting bouquet arrangement--place one on your vanity and one on your nightstand for a coordinated look.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TgL6jg5iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Briful","source_asin":"B0BGS4SYPJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-688420","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGS4SYPJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGS4SYPJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
