window.products.push({"id":688502,"name":"Vabaso 20 Piece Cocktail Shaker Set with Rotating Stand, 25oz Stainless Steel Black Bartender Kit Bar Tools Set for Home, Bars, Parties and Traveling,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QImRWhwoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍹 20Pcs Bar Tool Set --- Vabaso cocktail-making set contains all the accessories you need to make delicious cocktails. No matter you are a beginner or a bartender, it is good enough for you to make various classic cocktails! Set includes 750ml/ 25oz shaker, cocktail recipes, strainer, ice tongs, corkscrew, muddler, mixing spoon, rotating stand, 2 jiggers(15/30ml, 20/40ml), 2 bottle stoppers, 2 bottle pourers, 2 cocktail picks, 2 straws, 2 cleaning brushes. 🍹 360° Acrylic Rotating Stand --- Bartender set comes with a carefully designed rotating stand, easy to assemble and stable. Each item is easily reachable by rotating the stand. There's a fixed spot for every tool to keep your cocktail shaker set neat and organized, keep your counter tidy and beautiful and not take too much space. 🍹 Premium Stainless Steel Material --- All bartender kits are made of 18/8 stainless steel. Cocktail making safely & keep flavors, durable & rust-proof, not liquid leaking when shaking. Modern black plating makes them have a great finish and stylish appearance, adds elegance to your home bar(Please wash the cocktail set with a soft cleaning cloth to keep the shine and prevent scratches). 🍹 Enjoy Cocktail Making Fun --- Whether you're a bartender or a cocktail enthusiast, you can try to make a variety of delicious cocktails. The attached cocktail recipe booklet is a bonus for you to make various classic cocktails! Make some great mixing drinks to treat your friend on the weekend, such as Martini, Whiskey, Mojito, Rum, Gin, mixed drinks, creative cocktails, and more. You will be getting kudos for making stylish drinks. 🍹 Perfect Gift for Cocktail Lovers --- Contains all the necessities to make delicious cocktails, cocktail recipes booklet, elegant and the dark gray metallic color make this cocktail-making set become a great gift for anyone who’s interested in making cocktails and mixing drinks! Suit for Christmas, New Year, Birthday, Valentine's Day, Wedding, Party, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QImRWhwoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vabaso","source_asin":"B0B3RXXG6Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-688502","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3RXXG6Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3RXXG6Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
