window.products.push({"id":688517,"name":"Affordable Tin Antique Silver Plastic Ceiling Tile Flat 24\"x 24\" # 117 FIRE Rated, Can Be Glue On,Nail On,Staple On,Tape on Any Flat Surface! Glue on ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X-THfJ3qL._AC_.jpg","description":"Tin Antique finish plastic Ceiling Tile,are easy to install. Installation to a clean smooth surface with overlapping edges, design is 24\" x 24\" and actual size is 24.25\" x 24.25 \" to accommodate the 1/4 inch overlapping edge. Also available in standard Grid Size, 23.75\" x 23.75\" to allow you to glue to existing grid ceiling tile. Material: Rigid PVC (Poly Vinyl Chloride. Thickness: 0.27 mm Ceiling Tiles Class A Fire Rated. It is really quick and easy. 1. Prepare the surface: Wipe off the ceiling / surface and make it smooth and even. Remove loose plaster, paint, wall paper etc. 2. Center your room or Draw an angle: draw straight lines in the corner (in width and length part) and make a 90o angle, for starting point of pasting. 3. Apply the adhesive any good quality Contact Cement to a clean dry surface. 4. Place the sheet in the required position (first sheet at the 90o point) and press firmly. Long lasting & Durable Widest range to choose from Partly replaceable Colorable (Any good quality paint) No Fungus & Termite Effect Convenient Size 2' x 2' Washable (with mild detergent) Weatherproof Waterproof Light in weight Dust proof Recyclable Dimensionally stable Easy, Quick & Low cost in fixing Our PVC Ceiling Tiles can be easily cut with regular Scissors. In a Grid System or Suspended Ceiling our PVC Ceiling Tiles can be installed as an alternative using a support backing of plywood or similar item. We suggest when installing in a Grid, Suspended or Drop Ceiling System that it is a great idea to paint the grid after removal of any existing grid ceiling tile. We recommend painting the T-Bar or Grids with spray paint to match or coordinate to match your preferences. Should your Suspended Ceiling system be in size 24\" x 48\" you might consider converting to a 24\"x 24\" Grid or glue two 24\" x 24\" to your 24\" x 48\" ceiling tile.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X-THfJ3qL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CTBU","source_asin":"B000ORC3VI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-688517","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000ORC3VI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000ORC3VI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
