window.products.push({"id":688573,"name":"The Hamilton Collection Red Hot Mama Dachshund Figurine with Oversized Hat and Attitude","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YPwRba89L._AC_.jpg","description":"The long and short of it is that this Red Hot Mama is full of style and hat-titude! No dachshund lover will be able to resist falling for this darling dachshund figurine with her expressive, big brown eyes that will melt your heart. This adorable pampered pooch is dressed to the ca-nines donning an oversized wide-brimmed red hat with sculptural roses and real feathers. A long strand of \"pearls\" is draped around her neck and flows to the ground.This limited-edition doxie puppy is exclusively from The Hamilton Collection. She is handcrafted of artist's resin and meticulously hand-painted. She'll make a wonderful addition to your collection or a great gift for a dachshund lover. Strong demand is expected, so order now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YPwRba89L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Hamilton Collection","source_asin":"B00KI3OMIA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-688573","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KI3OMIA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KI3OMIA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":688574,"name":"Chama Premium Luxury 100% Cotton Basic Baby Hotel Kitchen Washcloths Towels 13\"x13\" Inch Face Cloths Towel Set of 12 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91+fhcUsckL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our wash cloths are designed to meet the daily needs of your whole family. The economy 12-pack means you can have a fresh wash cloth every day without running out quickly. Or you can divide them up and use them in the bathroom, keep a few in the kitchen, a few in the nursery, and tuck a few into your gym bag. Made of 100% Cotton, these premium luxury towels have an extra soft feel and are super absorbent.They are versatile enough to be a daily luxury also feel and look great for years that you won't feel guilty spending on! You will enjoy drying off with our silky smooth Towels.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91+fhcUsckL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHAMA","source_asin":"B079BDBY5F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-688574","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079BDBY5F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079BDBY5F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":688575,"name":"Exclusive District | Turkish Towel | Turkish Bath Towel | 100% Cotton | Beach Towel Peshtemal 38\"x70\", Aqua","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.4,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81M6Qcj5z+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⚠ WASH BEFORE USE ⚠ ✔ Washing your turkish towel before use will ensure their softness and improve absorbency. ✔You can also soak your towel in cool water overnight. This really helps your towel become more absorbent. ① What is Peshtemal / Turkish Towel? ✔ Turkish Towels are made from Turkish Cotton, a premium cotton that has extra long fibers. Using longer fiber cotton means fewer joins, which results in stronger and smoother cotton threads. Because of this unique material, Turkish towels are known to become even softer, fluffier and more absorbent with successive washings. ② How are Turkish Towels different from \"regular\" towels? ✔ The biggest difference is the type of weave. A Turkish towel is a flat weave where a \"regular\" towel is a terry cloth (loop weave). The flat weave allows the towel to be compact, super absorbent and fast drying. Exclusive District Towels are 100% Turkish Cotton which get softer and more absorbent over time vs. a terry cloth towel that can get stiff and scratchy with prolonged use. ③ Are they traditional? ✔ The history of the peshtemal is closely tied to the history of Hamams. The first Turkish Hamams, or public baths, were built in the 14th century, drawing on inspiration from Roman baths. ✔ The peshtemal became more culturally significant in the 17th century. In the Ottoman palace, the royal women and courtiers wanted peshtemals that were increasingly beautiful and ornate. They hired weavers to design beautifully decorated peshtemals. These peshtemals were hand-woven from cotton on a loom. ✔ Over the 17th century and afterwards, peshtemals were made in a wide range of styles and designs. They grew beyond their origins as a towel for the Turkish baths became an item of both fashion and utility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81M6Qcj5z+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Exclusive District","source_asin":"B077KT436W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-688575","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077KT436W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077KT436W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":688576,"name":"Olivia's Cloning Gel 2oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.76,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41H8CyBSBHL._AC_.jpg","description":"Olivia's Cloning Gel is the first and original plant cloning gel developed over 25 years ago for use in hydroponic cloning. Specifically formulated Olivia's cloning gel stimulates rapid root development for all types of plants with 90%-100% success rate. This amazing rooting hormone gel can be used on all indoor and outdoor plants - be it ornamentals or any and all flowers, fruits and vegetables. It's a concentrate so mix with your own water and feed daily. This rooting compound gel feeds new cuttings as they root and eliminate transplant shock for plants. Use Olivia's cloning gel for stems, leaf, softwood, semi-hard and some hardwood cuttings. Available in 2oz, 4oz and 8oz bottles, Olivia's rooting gel is manufactured using finest-quality ingredients. Note: No plant cloning gel should ever be ingested, see label for complete instructions on use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41H8CyBSBHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Olivia's","source_asin":"B001TNCX2A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-688576","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001TNCX2A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001TNCX2A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
