window.products.push({"id":688645,"name":"Boska Holland Dutch Cheesy Cheese Knife, Mini, Yellow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31bASrMhU4L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"At Boska Holland we've been crazy about cheese for over 100 years. It all started near Gouda, home of the original Gouda cheeses, where Willem Bos made his first cheese tools for local cheese farmers. From that day it's our family tradition to inspire you on your journey through the delicious cheeses of the world. Boska symbolizes cheese wares that have developed for your to enjoy cheese even more. Our assortment is so comprehensive that there is an appropriate tool, whether for the cheese professional or the home consumer, for every cheese lover. Cheese can be enjoyed anytime, anywhere. At Boska, we are constantly searching for new accessories to experience cheese in the traditional way, but innovative ways as well. Explore cheese and enjoy it. Go Dutch: experience cheese the fun way. This Dutch collection consists of playful, cheese accessories with a Dutch flavor. This cheese knife is specially designed to slice through semi hard cheese without sticking to the blade. The cheesy handle adds an extra dimension to the cheese experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31bASrMhU4L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOSKA","source_asin":"B004PPUOXO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-688645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004PPUOXO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004PPUOXO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
