window.products.push({"id":688776,"name":"Personalized Easter Egg Basket with Handle and Custom Name in Pink Script | Scallop Edge Linen Easter Basket Liners | White Basket | Woven Easter Bask","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SIa-hkJ4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Delight someone special this Easter with a personalized basket! Linen liner is embroidered with a name in pink and placed in a white basket ready to be filled with colorful eggs and sweet treats! Handle drops down for easy storage so that this basket can be used again year after year. This design does not support ALL CAPS. Please do not use all uppercase letters when personalizing. The basket is constructed of a woven softwood durable paper rope fiber metal interior frame with a removable basket liner. The collapsible handle provides convenience for Easter egg hunts and allows for easy storage. The basket measures 10.5 inches in diameter and has a 5.5-inch resting height and 12-inch total height with an upright handle. This personalized Easter basket will be the perfect gift on Easter morning that can also carry books, toys, and other items during the rest of the year. The liner includes tie closures so it can be removed from the basket for spot cleaning if needed. This item consists of a basket and personalized liner only. Personalized Planet is a leading online retailer specializing in personalized gifts for special occasions, holidays, and celebrations. Our wide selection of customized productions makes excellent gift ideas for birthdays, Christmas, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Grandparent gifts, and more. We also carry a large selection of licensed children's products for popular brands such as Sesame Street, Monster Jam, Wild Kratts, Daniel Tiger, Eric Carle, and others. Our officially licensed products include kids' beach towels, pillowcases, apparel, backpacks, room décor, and more. Personalized Planet provides the opportunity to give a truly unique and memorable gift!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SIa-hkJ4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Personalized Planet","source_asin":"B0BVMXP53D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-688776","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVMXP53D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVMXP53D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
