window.products.push({"id":688786,"name":"BALUXURY Acrylic Laundry Dryer Sheet Holder, Clear Dryer Sheets Container with Lid for Laundry Room","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JaMnFHsWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HINGED LID DESIGN: We understand the importance of keeping dryer sheets fresh and lasting. Let's be honest, the cardboard lid that dryer sheets come in do not do a great job at keeping them fresh and they lose their smell after just a few days to weeks. The hinged lid helps keep those dryer sheets smelling fresh so that they can do what they're designed to do: keep your clothes smelling great! PREMIUM QUALITY ACRYLIC: Our BALUXURY dryer sheet holder is made with high quality, industry grade acrylic to bring you a product that is durable, lightweight and ever-lasting for daily use. Low-quality acrylic materials turn yellow over time and have a noticeable smell. Foul odors are the last thing that should be near dryer sheets that leave a scent on your clothes. SIMPLISTIC STYLE: Our minimalistic and modern acrylic dryer sheet holder design is the perfect 2-in-1 product for your laundry room, providing function and style to your laundry room decor. Simply remove the dryer sheets out of their packaging and set them inside in the holder to keep them fresh. The clear and sleek design is the perfect upgrade and addition to any laundry room decor! DIMENSIONS: An acrylic dryer sheet from BALUXURY is the perfect size to fit in a laundry room cabinet or stowed on top of the dryer without taking up too much space! Our sheet holder measures 7.3 x 5 x 3.5 inches, allowing a storage of up to 150 standard sized dryer sheets. FUNCTIONAL: Tiny rubber feet on the bottom of the dryer sheet holder help prevent sliding when you grab sheets, making it ideal for using on the laundry room countertop or the top of the dryer and washing machine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JaMnFHsWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BALUXURY","source_asin":"B0B5WSQK4N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-688786","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5WSQK4N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5WSQK4N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
