window.products.push({"id":688847,"name":"SigMntun Best 40th Anniversary Wedding Gifts for Couple, Parents - Anniversary Decorations and Marriage Gifts for Precious Moments, card included - A+","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d47TQlDIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Product Dimensions】6” x 6” x 1”, 2.6 lbs. Twice as thick and three times as heavy as other similar products. 【A+ Grade Crystal Glass】Unlike industrial acrylic materials, crystal glass has an A+ grade of clarity and will never age or turn yellow. 【Ultra-high Clarity】The crystal glass material of this heart is often used in the manufacture of lenses; it has ultra-high clarity. 【More Stable Placement】The one-inch thickness allows it to stand securely. 【Unique Design】This crystal heart is designed by professional designers, unlike other product pictures randomly downloaded from the Internet. 【WYSIWYG】What you see is what you get. The crystal heart will only be more amazing than the picture.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d47TQlDIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SigMntun","source_asin":"B0BMXWGYBC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-688847","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMXWGYBC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMXWGYBC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":688848,"name":"BJecommerce Tabletop Portable Ethanol Fireplace","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51d5n-QwzYL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"- CLEAN BURNING FUE: This table top fire pit bowl uses alcohol as a combustion energy source. Producing a vibrant orange, dancing flame without irritating smoke or mess. It’s free from soot and ash and emits nothing more than heat, water vapor and CO2.so you don't have to worry about harmful emissions. For best results, we recommend using 91% Isopropyl alcohol fuel.Please remember not to ever pour/refill fuel onto open fire or when burner/fireplace is not cool to touch. - VENTLESS AND PORTABLE: This portable tabletop ventless fireplace is light and easy to transport so you can move the fire bowl anywhere.You could use this mini personal fireplace to add warmth and ambience to your desk, side table in your living room, centerpiece for your main dining table, or anywhere outdoors. -WARN NOTICE: No ethanol fuel is included in the package. Burn time is approximately 60-70 minutes when fully filled with fuel; Please use alcohol with a concentration of 95% or higher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51d5n-QwzYL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BJecommerce","source_asin":"B0B14FTJNQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-688848","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B14FTJNQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B14FTJNQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":688849,"name":"Primitives by Kathy Rustic-Inspired Throw Pillow, 16\", Cream/Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aqWrd8m4L._AC_.jpg","description":"CAREFULLY BUY ONLY FROM AMAZON or trusted Amazon partners to guarantee authentic pillows with premium quality printing, stitching, and fabrics. Spot clean only with a damp cloth. In 1997, Kathy made her first \"primitive candle box\" by hand, taking care into each detail from the sanded edges to the type of ribbon tied on the wire handles, each was a work of passion. As Primitives by Kathy grows, the company works to give back, starting with an initial relationship with Goodwill Services and expanding into several more charitable causes held both by the company and those the company supports on behalf of their employees. They are constantly inspired by the people, places and things around us. Kathy travels the world to pull inspiration first hand from cultures around the globe. Look for all of Primitives by Kathy for inspirational, fun, sarcastic, and heart-warming gifts and home decor. You'll want to have one for yourself and another for someone you care about.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aqWrd8m4L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Primitives by Kathy","source_asin":"B07WFBWS4X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-688849","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WFBWS4X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WFBWS4X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":688850,"name":"French Bulldog Grey by Michael Tompsett, 18x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XSI6uQ2EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a colorful portrait of a French Bulldog. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies. After 12 years Michael Tompsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Although Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, his main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Tompsett creates urban landmark and cityscape designs. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XSI6uQ2EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B01MZ26NMZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-688850","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MZ26NMZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MZ26NMZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
