window.products.push({"id":688862,"name":"Oroonoko Large Shoe Box for Storage Sneakers,6 Packs Hard Plastic Stackable Display Shoe Box With Lip Clear Door for Sneakers Heels Up To US Size 13''","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zFWQqk0BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Large Size】The Stackable size of box is 14.7 \"L x 10.5\" W x 1.97 \"H, expand size 14.7”x 10.5”x 8.3”fits shoe maximum US size 13 that big enough for men’s shoes or women’s shoes. It fits most men’s sneaker shoes and women's heels(Size 5-13).Comes in 3 pack shoe boxes.They are big enough for more than one pair of shoes. 【Sturdy and Foldable】Our shoe case is made of high quality PP plastic.Our foldable sneakers case is stronger than ordinary plastics case on the market.You can superimpose the shoes box freely and keep it from falling when tilting.The shoe storage bin can be arranged to suit various scence,e.g. entryway,bedroom,dinning room,closet and under the bed ect. 【Transparent Display Design】Display and Storage your favorite sneakers and heel with a clear front window and door.Our display shoes box make your closet space back.The stackable boxes are perfect choice for your closet and bedroom,it makes your room and space clean and elegant. 【Easy Assemble】The surface is resistant to abrasion and aging. Its thick design guarantees its reliability and durability.The sneaker storage box come disassembled and requires simple assembly with clear instructions. 【Multi-Purpose Boxes】The stackable is not only for shoes,but also an ideal organizer for cosmetics, socks, sweaters, paper towels, underwear, clothes, stationery etc. in closet, home and kitchen.You can use it to storage everything.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zFWQqk0BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oroonoko","source_asin":"B0BYMRD2C8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-688862","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYMRD2C8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYMRD2C8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":688863,"name":"KitchenAid KP2671XGN Professional 6-Quart Stand Mixer, Empire Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BJRBRTZQL._AC_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com With a 525-watt motor to handle bread doughs and thick cookie batters, this is KitchenAid's most powerful stand mixer, a professional-grade appliance with a heavy, rugged, all-metal construction (31.7 pounds) which prevents \"counter walk\" on the mixer's rubber feet. It has a 6-quart, polished stainless-steel bowl with an ergonomic handle and a two-piece pouring shield made of heavyweight plastic to provide a large chute for adding ingredients. Accompanying the mixer are a burnished flat beater, a burnished dough hook, and a big wire whip. On the front of the powerhead is a hinged cover for the hub to which KitchenAid's many mixer accessories attach. This mixer's great features abound. An electronic sensor ensures mixing action remains at the speed selected from among the 10 available--even when the going gets tough. Mixing begins softly to prevent splatters and \"flour puff.\" With the beater moving clockwise and the shaft moving counterclockwise there's no need to rotate the bowl for the beater to reach all ingredients. The bowl-lift lever functions easily. A ventilation system cools the entire mixer to prolong motor life, and a resettable overload-protection system prevents overheating. The mixer measures 11-3/8 inches wide, 16-1/2 inches high, and 14-5/8 inches deep. KitchenAid says the first year of the mixer's lifetime warranty against defects is \"hassle-free,\" with a replacement shipped at no cost and without question if a defect is detected. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BJRBRTZQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenAid","source_asin":"B0000638SP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-688863","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000638SP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000638SP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
