window.products.push({"id":688891,"name":"Polder 49-Inch Tri-Leg Ironing Station, Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41VmmMSw-tL._AC_.jpg","description":"Polder has been offering everyday products with extraordinary design since its launch. The company was established in 1976, delivering better quality European-styled housewares to the U.S. market. Polder found early in success in ironing and storage, and also launched the industry's first line of digital in-oven thermometers, equipped with a long cord so consumers could digitally monitor food without removing it from the oven. Through the years, Polder has built an eclectic collection of core home categories, including kitchen timers and thermometers, laundry and ironing products, kitchen scales, and a variety of other storage solutions. Polder products are tested and certified for their consistent high quality by independent standards labs. How do you store an ironing board and steaming hot iron together without waiting through a cool down period? Polder has developed an exclusive iron holster which not only allows the user to place a hot iron down while pausing during the ironing process, but enables him or her to immediately store the iron upon completion. Simply lift, load, wrap and put away the iron and board, hot or cold.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41VmmMSw-tL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Polder","source_asin":"B00460JP24","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-688891","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00460JP24","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00460JP24","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
